<title>USA: Sumner, Wash., yields 5.60 pct in 2017.</title>
<headline>Sumner, Wash., yields 5.60 pct in 2017.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it received the verbal award for $8.070 million of Sumner, Wash., water and sewer revenue bonds, 1997 with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2017.</p>
